  "description": "### GTIF AT EA – Austrian Climate Change Explorer for Tourism\n\n\n\n*Climate threats*\n\n\n\nVisualization of flood, snow decline, avalanche, heat episode, and hot day (>30°C) risks aggregated at the level of Austrian tourism destinations.\n\n\n\nBy selecting one or more tourism destinations on the map, the distribution of risk levels within each destination can be explored and compared.\n\n\n\nRead narrative (general) and (use case 2) for a more detailed description.",
